  "_comment": "Theme documents (_type: 'genreTheme') referenced by campaigns. Two kinds: genre defaults (what a new campaign gets automatically based on its genre) and campaign-specific overrides (a campaign can point at its own custom theme instead of its genre's default). The dossier template components are identical either way — only these tokens/labels change.",

